      "reason": "Clarify novelty and optimization behavior relative to established residual gating, including sigmoid saturation at bias two.",
      "query": "How do Highway Networks, ReZero, LayerScale and Hierarchical Gating Networks compare with an identity-initialized NextItNet residual gate g=sigmoid(W[h;u;e;c]+2)/sigmoid(2), where c is a causal four-item embedding mean? Examine conditional versus static scaling, initialization gradients and redundant conditioning."
