      "reason": "Resolve implementation and diagnostic requirements before spending the fixed training budget.",
      "query": "What verification procedures establish causal dependency spans, baseline-equivalent initialization, optimizer inclusion of newly added gates and save/reload predictor parity for gated causal dilated convolution networks in PyTorch? Include left-padding masks and activation-patching limitations when raw input embeddings feed gates in every residual block."
